*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: SP and SB of WinPilot are not part of the specification. Each is reported once.

AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR
SP 0,1,0,0,255
SB 0,0,255
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

AC C
AY TMA
AN Example TMA
SP 0,1,0,0,255
AH FL95
AL 4500 FT AMSL
V X=46:30:00N 014:30:00E
DC 5
